# DatoCMS Schema Migrations

Guide for creating, testing, and deploying DatoCMS schema migration scripts.

---

## When to use

- Creating new DatoCMS models, blocks, or fields
- Modifying existing schema (adding enum values, changing validators, appearances)
- Debugging a failing migration script
- Promoting a tested migration to production

**Not for:** pure content editing (use the DatoCMS UI), or frontend component
work with no schema change (use `/webpage-cms-component`).

---

## Key References

| Topic | Location |
|---|---|
| Migration files | `webpage/lib/datoCms/migrations/` |
| Migration utilities | `webpage/lib/datoCms/migrations/utils/` |
